Pour configurer avec vtish :

> vtish
> configure t

interface eth0
  ip address 10.42.42.2/16
  ip ospf area 0
!
interface lo
  ip address 1.1.1.2/32
  ip ospf area 0
!
router bgp 1
  neighbor 1.1.1.1 remote-as 1
  neighbor 1.1.1.1 update-source lo
  !
  address-family l2vpn evpn
    neighbor 1.1.1.1 activate
    advertise-all-vni
  exit-address-family
!
router ospf
!